  "notes": [
    "CanonicalTag v1 Final is frozen. This overlay is applied at buildLexicon time only.",
    "Owner Final 2026-08-17: all grade-B locale suppression is REMOVED. The suppression safety review judged 8 of 20 removed edges as genuine matches (40% false removal), so per-locale blanket rules are not acceptable as production rules.",
    "chef carries no rule at all: its description evidence is restored in every locale.",
    "Bare luna no longer triggers werewolf-luna from description in any locale. The keyword failed in both directions - 47.1% false positives among survivors and 38% false removals among suppressed edges - so the locale axis was never the real problem.",
    "werewolf-luna the CanonicalTag is retained. Title behaviour is unchanged because this round produced no title precision evidence. Future description triggering requires an explicit phrase seed validated by independent evidence; ambiguous cases go to Offline LLM enrichment.",
    "No new suppression rules were added for princess / crown-prince / student: they are observation items only.",
    "Language 19/20 remain RAW_SCOPE_ONLY with name [null] and are never listed here.",
    "Removing he/be zeroes description-only triggering for happy-ending and tragic-ending, and disabling bare luna does the same for werewolf-luna. That is expected, not a defect.",
    "Title is never restricted: the blind reviews covered description-only edges only."
  ],
